436
00:33:09.820 --> 00:33:15.040
το λαό σου παράσκου το μεγαέλαιο.

437
00:33:15.700 --> 00:33:19.700
Και νυν και αοικέεις τους αιώνας των αιώνων,

438
00:33:19.920 --> 00:33:27.000
αμήν υπερευλογημένη υπάρχεις Θεοτό και παρθένε,

439
00:33:27.000 --> 00:33:29.980
Διαγάρτου εξούς αρκωμένου

440
00:33:30.000 --> 00:33:46.920
ο θέντος, ο άδης ηχμαλώτης ται, ο αδάμ ανάκαι κλητέ, η κατάραν νεκροτέ, η ευαϊνλευθέρωτε, ο θάνατος ται θανάτοτε,

441
00:33:46.920 --> 00:33:59.260
και ημίσες ζωποιήθημεν δύο ανυμνούντες βόμεν ευλογητός Χριστός ο Θεός ημών

442
00:34:00.000 --> 00:34:05.760
ο ούτως ευδοκής σας δόξα σύν.

443
00:34:06.200 --> 00:34:12.600
Ευλογητός η Κύριε διδαξόν με τα δικαίωματά σου,

444
00:34:12.780 --> 00:34:17.960
τον αγγέλων ο Δήμος κατεπλάγι ορών σε,

445
00:34:18.100 --> 00:34:25.400
ενεκρής λογηστέντα του θάνατου δε σωτήρ την ισχύν καθελώντα,

446
00:34:25.400 --> 00:34:29.180
και σ&#x27; ειναι αυτόν τον Αδά με Γύραντα

447
00:34:30.000 --> 00:34:33.620
Εξάδου πάντας ελευθερός αντά.

448
00:34:34.600 --> 00:34:40.660
Ευλογητός η Κύριε διδάξον με τα δικαιώματά σου,

449
00:34:41.040 --> 00:34:47.440
τι τα μοίρας ημπαθος της δάκρυσην, ο μαθητριε κυρνάται,

450
00:34:47.960 --> 00:34:54.480
ο αστράπτον εν το τάφο άγγελος προσευθέν και τότε σμυροφόρης.

451
00:34:54.480 --> 00:34:59.980
Είδετε, είμείς των τάφων και είσθητε, ως ότι είστε.

452
00:35:00.000 --> 00:35:04.320
Ρεξανέστη του μνήματον.

453
00:35:04.340 --> 00:35:12.600
Ευλογητός η Κύριε διδαξον με τα δικαιωμάτα σου λείαν.

454
00:35:12.720 --> 00:35:18.620
Πρωί μυροφόριε δραμον προς το μνήμα σου θρηνολογούσε.

455
00:35:18.800 --> 00:35:22.840
Αλέπες τι προς αυτός ο άγγελος και είπε,

456
00:35:22.840 --> 00:35:29.980
Τρινού ο καιρός π&#x27; αυτε μη πλέτε την Ανάσταση δε αποστολή.

457
00:35:48.880 --> 00:35:51.680
Υπότιτλοι AUTHORWAVE

458
00:36:12.320 --> 00:36:14.800
Υπότιτλοι AUTHORWAVE

459
00:36:58.580 --> 00:36:59.980
Κύριε.

460
00:37:02.060 --> 00:37:09.000
Αλληλούια, Αλληλούια, Αλληλούια, Δόξα σύ ο Θεός.

461
00:37:33.540 --> 00:37:37.440
ΑΕΤΙΚΕΤΕΤΕΝ ΕΕΡΗΝΗ ΤΗ ΚΥΡΙΟ ΔΕΙΘΟΜΕΝ

462
00:37:38.000 --> 00:37:41.000
ΚΥΡΙΗ ΕΛΕΙΣΟΝ

463
00:37:41.000 --> 00:37:49.340
Σας ευχαριστώ.

464
00:38:00.000 --> 00:38:05.820
Αυτός και λύλος και πάσαν την ζωήν ημών Χριστό το Θεό παραθώ μεθά.

465
00:38:06.060 --> 00:38:08.320
Συ Κύριε.

466
00:38:08.700 --> 00:38:16.000
Ότι ευλογητέ σου το όνομα και το δοξαστέ σου η Βασιλεία του Πατρός και του Υιού και του Άγιου Πνεύματος,

467
00:38:17.100 --> 00:38:20.000
νυν και αϊκέις τους αιώνας των αιώνων.

468
00:38:22.220 --> 00:38:22.940
Αμήν.

469
00:38:23.400 --> 00:38:29.360
Μετά το πάθος πορευθείσαι εν το μνήματι, προς το μυρίσε το σώμα σου, εγυναίκες Χριστέ ο Θεός.

470
00:38:29.360 --> 00:38:29.980
Υπότιτλοι AUTHORWAVE

471
00:38:30.000 --> 00:38:38.940
Είδω να γγέλουσεν το τάφο και εξέστησαν φωνείς γαρίκουον εξ αυτών, ότι ανέστη ο Κύριος παρέχον το κόσμο το μέγα έλεος.

472
00:38:41.780 --> 00:38:51.780
Εν το ουρανό τα ώματα εκπέμπω μου της καρδίας προς εσωτείρους όσον με ση επιλάμψει.

473
00:38:56.800 --> 00:38:59.600
Υπότιτλοι AUTHORWAVE

474
00:39:00.000 --> 00:39:04.860
Κι δώς προς θέλους τρόπους του μετανοήν Σοι.

475
00:39:05.220 --> 00:39:08.800
Φόξα Πατρί και Υό και Άγιο Πνεύματι.

476
00:39:08.980 --> 00:39:14.320
Δίν και Άγιο και Ιστους αιώνας των αιώνων αμήν.

477
00:39:14.620 --> 00:39:23.940
Άγιο Πνεύματι το βασιλεύειν πέλη το Άγι Άζιν το Κινήν την κτίσην Θεός γαρεστήν,

478
00:39:23.940 --> 00:39:27.320
ο Μαούσιος πατρί και λόγο

479
00:39:27.320 --> 00:39:29.980
γυμιώτη Κύριος η Λόγωνα

480
00:39:30.000 --> 00:39:39.740
Είναιν ημήν θυσικανός ως φυλακτήνε, εκ του εχθρού άμα και ανθρώποκτονου.

481
00:39:40.180 --> 00:39:47.000
Ισοδούς ειν αυτόν μη παραδώσο τερ των σονβούλων, λέοντος τρόπον,

482
00:39:47.760 --> 00:39:51.900
κατέ μου κινούνται και γάρι εχθροί μου.

483
00:39:51.900 --> 00:39:55.380
Ω ξαπαδρή και ιό και Άγιο Πνεύματι,

484
00:39:55.800 --> 00:39:59.980
και είν και αεί και εις τους αιώνας των αιών,

485
00:40:00.000 --> 00:40:08.260
Αγίω πνευματίζω αρχή, χία και γέρας πάντα γάρτα κτιστά,

486
00:40:08.620 --> 00:40:14.980
ως Θεός ον δύναμη συντηρεί εν πατρίδι ουδέ.

487
00:40:15.780 --> 00:40:21.760
Υπεπιθώτες επί Κύριον, εήκα συνόρι το Αγίο,

488
00:40:22.320 --> 00:40:27.400
Ιουδαμος αλεύονται προσβολές του βελία.

489
00:40:27.400 --> 00:40:29.980
Ενώνομοι εσχύρασοι

490
00:40:30.000 --> 00:40:40.440
Αγίος Αυτόν μη εκτινάτως ανηθίως όντες, ουγάρε α Χριστός τη ράβδο των κλήρων αυτού.

491
00:40:41.000 --> 00:40:50.340
Ω ξαπατρί και Υιώ και Αγίω Πνεύματι και την Θεά η καίης τους αιώνας των αιώνων αμήν.

492
00:40:50.340 --> 00:40:59.980
Καίοι ο Πνεύματι προσπηγάζει πάσα σοφία, ενθεν χάρις Αποστόλης και της άθλης κατάστασης.

493
00:41:00.000 --> 00:41:05.280
τα στέφονται μάρτυρες και προφήται ορόσι.

494
00:41:07.340 --> 00:41:17.380
Εξεγέρθητη Κύριε ο Θεός μου, εν προστάγματιό εν αιτήλο, και συναγωγή λαόν κυκλώσησε.

495
00:41:17.740 --> 00:41:28.520
Εξεγέρθητη Κύριε ο Θεός μου, εν προστάγματιό εν αιτήλο, και συναγωγή λαόν κυκλώσησε.

496
00:41:53.080 --> 00:41:56.800
Again and again in peace let us pray to the Lord.

497
00:41:56.800 --> 00:41:59.260
Lord, have mercy.

498
00:42:00.000 --> 00:42:02.480
Help us, save us, have mercy on us,

499
00:42:02.580 --> 00:42:05.500
and protect us, O God, by your grace.

500
00:42:06.000 --> 00:42:07.820
Lord, have mercy.

501
00:42:09.100 --> 00:42:12.120
Remembering our most holy, pure, blessed, and glorious

502
00:42:12.120 --> 00:42:15.180
Lady Theothokos and ever-Virgin Mary

503
00:42:15.180 --> 00:42:16.240
with all the saints,

504
00:42:16.240 --> 00:42:19.480
let us commend ourselves and one another

505
00:42:19.480 --> 00:42:22.620
and our whole life to Christ our God.

506
00:42:22.860 --> 00:42:24.740
To you, O Lord.

507
00:42:25.300 --> 00:42:28.720
For you are the King of peace and Saviour of our souls,

508
00:42:28.720 --> 00:42:29.960
and to you we offer glory.

509
00:42:30.000 --> 00:42:33.780
Glory to the Father and the Son and the Holy Spirit,

510
00:42:34.240 --> 00:42:40.140
now and forever and unto the ages of ages.

511
00:42:42.380 --> 00:42:42.940
Amen.

512
00:42:45.960 --> 00:42:48.100
Worshiping not the image made by hands,

513
00:42:48.240 --> 00:42:51.180
but putting on the breastplate of the unwritten essence,

514
00:42:51.340 --> 00:42:55.500
in the arena of fire you thrice-blessed ones were glorified.

515
00:42:55.960 --> 00:42:58.320
Standing in the midst of a flame unendurable,

516
00:42:58.500 --> 00:42:59.440
you called upon God.

517
00:43:00.000 --> 00:43:05.440
Make haste, O compassionate one, and hurry as the merciful one unto our aid,

518
00:43:05.740 --> 00:43:10.160
for you can do what you will.

519
00:43:11.500 --> 00:43:14.640
Extend your hand, which of old the Egyptians, making battle,

520
00:43:14.740 --> 00:43:17.200
and the Hebrews, then embattled, had experienced.

521
00:43:17.640 --> 00:43:21.520
Do not forsake us, that death, who thirsts after us,

522
00:43:21.560 --> 00:43:23.620
and Satan, who hates us, may drink us down.

523
00:43:24.160 --> 00:43:28.880
But be near us and spare our souls, as you once spared your lads in Babylon,

524
00:43:28.880 --> 00:43:29.980
as they see

525
00:43:30.000 --> 00:43:31.480
ceaselessly sang your praises,

526
00:43:32.040 --> 00:43:34.300
and were for you thrown into the furnace,

527
00:43:34.400 --> 00:43:36.280
and from thence called to you.

528
00:43:36.620 --> 00:43:38.420
Make haste, O compassionate one,

529
00:43:38.600 --> 00:43:41.120
and hurry as the merciful one unto our aid.

530
00:43:41.660 --> 00:43:46.960
For you can do what you will.

531
00:43:49.720 --> 00:43:51.340
On the 14th of this month,

532
00:43:51.340 --> 00:43:54.280
we commemorate the contest of the holy martyrs

533
00:43:54.280 --> 00:43:56.860
Thyrsus, Lucius, and Kalinicus.

534
00:43:57.460 --> 00:43:59.800
On this day, we commemorate the holy martyrs

535
00:43:59.800 --> 00:43:59.880
Thank you.

536
00:44:00.000 --> 00:44:03.640
Philemon, Apollyonos, Arianos, and those with them.

537
00:44:04.140 --> 00:44:06.660
On this day we also commemorate the four guards

538
00:44:06.660 --> 00:44:08.940
who contested together with Arianos.

539
00:44:09.380 --> 00:44:11.880
On this day we also commemorate the great love

540
00:44:11.880 --> 00:44:14.520
which was shown to us when we were delivered

541
00:44:14.520 --> 00:44:17.440
from the fearful threat of earthquake by our benevolent Lord.

542
00:44:18.200 --> 00:44:21.080
Today is also the Sunday of the Holy Forefathers.

543
00:44:21.740 --> 00:44:24.220
By the intercessions of your saints, O God,

544
00:44:24.440 --> 00:44:27.080
have mercy on us and save us. Amen.

545
00:44:33.460 --> 00:44:34.540
Ananis.

546
00:44:37.700 --> 00:44:43.260
Christ is born, glorify Him.

547
00:44:43.740 --> 00:44:49.060
Christ is come from heaven, go and meet Him.

548
00:44:49.460 --> 00:44:53.800
Christ is on earth, arise to Him.

549
00:44:53.800 --> 00:44:59.980
Sing to the Lord, all you inhabitants of the world.

550
00:45:00.000 --> 00:45:12.120
And all you peoples praise him, and with merriment extol him who is glorified.

551
00:45:12.120 --> 00:45:22.860
To the Son begotten from the Father unchangingly before the ages,

552
00:45:23.320 --> 00:45:29.980
and now becoming incarnate from the Virgin without sight.

553
00:45:30.000 --> 00:45:35.060
To Christ God let us cry aloud,

554
00:45:35.380 --> 00:45:41.060
You have exalted the horn of our strength,

555
00:45:41.460 --> 00:45:46.140
Only you are holy, O Lord.

556
00:45:47.560 --> 00:45:51.400
A rod has come forth from Jesse&#x27;s root,

557
00:45:51.620 --> 00:45:55.200
And you its flower grew from it.

558
00:45:55.200 --> 00:45:59.900
Praiseworthy Christ, now born of the earth.

559
00:46:00.000 --> 00:46:04.020
whom Habakkuk called Paran,

560
00:46:04.480 --> 00:46:07.000
shady, thickly wooded mountain,

561
00:46:08.020 --> 00:46:13.220
from her who knew no man you came incarnate.

562
00:46:13.560 --> 00:46:21.000
O immaterial God, glory to your strength, O Lord.

563
00:46:22.940 --> 00:46:27.000
O God of peace and Father of mercies,

564
00:46:27.300 --> 00:46:29.900
You have sent.

565
00:46:30.000 --> 00:46:33.880
to us the wonderful Counselor,

566
00:46:34.300 --> 00:46:37.940
the angel of your great counsel,

567
00:46:37.940 --> 00:46:40.320
granting us peace.

568
00:46:40.560 --> 00:46:43.700
And now to light of knowledge

569
00:46:43.700 --> 00:46:46.860
of God we have been guided,

570
00:46:47.200 --> 00:46:50.480
and we rise from night to dawn

571
00:46:50.480 --> 00:46:56.260
and glorify you, O benevolent Lord.

572
00:46:56.260 --> 00:46:57.280
Lord.

573
00:47:00.000 --> 00:47:06.160
Jonah long ago was hurled from the belly of the whale,

574
00:47:06.380 --> 00:47:13.800
as he went in like a newborn babe with the virgin now,

575
00:47:14.140 --> 00:47:20.260
when the logos had dwelt in his mother&#x27;s womb.

576
00:47:20.460 --> 00:47:26.320
Taking flesh, he then emerged, preserving her intact,

577
00:47:28.260 --> 00:47:29.900
yielding not to a chance.

578
00:47:30.000 --> 00:47:38.200
In changeability, he preserved her unaltered in childbirth.

579
00:47:40.180 --> 00:47:45.120
Brought up together piously the servants,

580
00:47:45.500 --> 00:47:50.920
With contempt regarded the impious king&#x27;s decree.

581
00:47:51.320 --> 00:47:56.700
The threat of the furnace did not frighten them,

582
00:47:56.700 --> 00:47:59.980
Rather standing in the middle of the church.

583
00:48:00.000 --> 00:48:03.780
midst of the flames they prayed and sang,

584
00:48:04.420 --> 00:48:10.420
Blessed are you, O Lord God of our fathers.

585
00:48:12.740 --> 00:48:18.280
We praise and we bless and we worship the Lord.

586
00:48:19.140 --> 00:48:24.120
Babylon&#x27;s bedoing furnace bore the image

587
00:48:24.120 --> 00:48:28.940
of an extraordinary wonder.

588
00:48:30.000 --> 00:48:35.160
For it did not burn the youths it was holding,

589
00:48:35.500 --> 00:48:39.600
nor did the fire of divinity

590
00:48:39.600 --> 00:48:44.620
consume the virgin&#x27;s womb wherein it went.

591
00:48:44.900 --> 00:48:50.340
And so let us songfully extol and praise.

592
00:48:50.560 --> 00:48:56.520
Let all creation bless the Lord, sing I him to him,

593
00:48:56.520 --> 00:48:59.860
and exalt him beyond man.

594
00:49:01.400 --> 00:49:04.260
unto all the ages.

595
00:49:11.780 --> 00:49:14.100
Let us pray to the Lord.

596
00:49:14.460 --> 00:49:16.020
Lord, have mercy.

597
00:49:16.640 --> 00:49:18.420
For you, our God, are holy,

598
00:49:18.420 --> 00:49:20.880
and you rest among the holy ones.

599
00:49:21.100 --> 00:49:23.500
And to you we offer up glory

600
00:49:23.500 --> 00:49:27.180
to the Father and the Son and the Holy Spirit

601
00:49:27.180 --> 00:49:29.140
now and forever.

602
00:49:29.140 --> 00:49:29.980
you

603
00:49:30.000 --> 00:49:32.500
And to the ages of ages.

604
00:49:33.440 --> 00:49:33.820
Amen.

605
00:49:34.260 --> 00:49:37.700
Let everything that breathes praise the Lord.

606
00:49:38.040 --> 00:49:41.740
Pass up no ienesatot on Kyrian.

607
00:49:42.220 --> 00:49:46.220
Let everything that breathes praise the Lord.

608
00:49:52.300 --> 00:49:58.140
Let us pray to the Lord our God that we may be made worthy to hear the holy gospel.

609
00:49:58.660 --> 00:49:59.980
Lord, have mercy, Lord.

610
00:50:00.000 --> 00:50:02.600
Lord, have mercy, Lord, have mercy.

611
00:50:03.580 --> 00:50:06.820
Wisdom arise, let us hear the Holy Gospel.

612
00:50:07.300 --> 00:50:09.740
Peace be with you all.

613
00:50:09.780 --> 00:50:12.180
And with your spirit.

614
00:50:13.620 --> 00:50:17.060
The reading is from the Holy Gospel according to Luke.

615
00:50:17.620 --> 00:50:20.080
Wisdom, let us be attentive.

616
00:50:21.100 --> 00:50:25.460
Glory to you, O Lord, glory to you.

617
00:50:27.120 --> 00:50:29.980
At that time, two of them were going to a village.

618
00:50:30.000 --> 00:50:33.000
named Emmaus about seven miles from Jerusalem

619
00:50:33.000 --> 00:50:34.440
and talking with each other

620
00:50:34.440 --> 00:50:36.660
about all these things that had happened.

621
00:50:37.200 --> 00:50:39.640
While they were talking and discussing together,

622
00:50:39.880 --> 00:50:42.200
Jesus himself drew near and went with them.

623
00:50:42.560 --> 00:50:45.220
But their eyes were kept from recognizing him,

624
00:50:45.280 --> 00:50:46.160
and he said to them,

625
00:50:46.340 --> 00:50:48.240
What is this conversation

626
00:50:48.240 --> 00:50:50.820
which you are holding with each other as you walk?

627
00:50:51.140 --> 00:50:53.440
And they stood still, looking sad.

628
00:50:53.720 --> 00:50:56.400
Then one of them named Cleopas answered him,

629
00:50:56.740 --> 00:50:58.820
Are you the only visitor to Jerusalem

630
00:50:58.820 --> 00:50:59.900
who does not know

631
00:51:00.000 --> 00:51:05.580
the things that have happened there in these days? And he said to them, What things? And they said to

632
00:51:05.580 --> 00:51:12.060
him, Concerning Jesus of Nazareth, who was a prophet mighty in deed and word before God and all the

633
00:51:12.060 --> 00:51:17.340
people, and how our chief priests and rulers delivered him up to be condemned to death and

634
00:51:17.340 --> 00:51:23.480
crucified him. But we had hoped that he was the one to redeem Israel. Yes, and besides all this,

635
00:51:23.560 --> 00:51:29.680
it is now the third day since this happened. Moreover, some women of our company amazed us.

636
00:51:29.680 --> 00:51:29.980
they were

637
00:51:30.000 --> 00:51:34.920
were at the tomb early in the morning and did not find his body. And they came back saying that they

638
00:51:34.920 --> 00:51:42.000
had even seen a vision of angels who said that he was alive. Some of those who were with us went to

639
00:51:42.000 --> 00:51:48.160
the tomb and found it just as the women had said, but him they did not see. And he said to them,

640
00:51:48.640 --> 00:51:55.140
O foolish men and slow of heart to believe all that the prophets have spoken, was it not necessary

641
00:51:55.140 --> 00:51:57.060
that the Christ should suffer these things

642
00:51:57.060 --> 00:51:58.340
and enter into his glory?

643
00:51:58.820 --> 00:51:59.980
And beginning with...

644
00:52:00.000 --> 00:52:05.060
Moses and all the prophets, he interpreted to them and all the scriptures the things concerning

645
00:52:05.060 --> 00:52:12.280
himself. So they drew near to the village to which they were going. He appeared to be going further,

646
00:52:12.440 --> 00:52:17.780
but they constrained him, saying, Stay with us, for it is toward evening, and the day is now far

647
00:52:17.780 --> 00:52:23.920
spent. So he went in to stay with them. When he was at table with them, he took the bread and

648
00:52:23.920 --> 00:52:29.100
blessed and broken and gave it to them. And their eyes were opened, and they recognized him, and he

649
00:52:29.100 --> 00:52:29.980
vanished out.

650
00:52:30.000 --> 00:52:36.600
of their sight. They said to each other, Did not our hearts burn within us while he spoke to us on

